  <artifactId>workflow-expression</artifactId>
  <name>workflow-expression</name>
  <description>
    The workflow expression language (lexer, parser, evaluator, built-ins,
    template scanner and lint): package com.agenticai.core.workflow.expression,
    unchanged. A pure leaf library with no Spring beans and no dependency on
    the workflow module; workflow, workflow-portability and the editor
    endpoints depend on it, never the reverse. Split out of core/workflow
    (module-size ratchet).
  </description>

